{"3538320": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Air Dash: Sky Racing Simulator", "steam_appid": 3538320, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the skies in <strong>Air Dash: Sky Racing Simulator</strong>, the ultimate arcade-style flight racing experience. Push the throttle, master the controls, and outfly your rivals across a variety of thrilling maps and high-speed challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✈️ Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Split-Screen Racing</strong> – Compete with friends locally in fast-paced split-screen mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Maps &amp; Tracks</strong> – From city skylines to mountain valleys and open seas, every race brings a new challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Garage &amp; Customization</strong> – Unlock and upgrade a wide selection of planes. Personalize your aircraft with unique skins and tuning options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Gameplay</strong> – Drift through sharp turns, boost through checkpoints, and soar through obstacles at breakneck speeds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcade &amp; Simulator Blend</strong> – Easy to pick up, but with enough depth for flight sim fans.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re chasing records solo or battling side by side with a friend, <strong>Air Dash</strong> delivers the perfect mix of speed, competition, and sky-high adrenaline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to <strong>dash through the skies</strong> and become the ultimate air racer?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the skies in <strong>Air Dash: Sky Racing Simulator</strong>, the ultimate arcade-style flight racing experience. Push the throttle, master the controls, and outfly your rivals across a variety of thrilling maps and high-speed challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb